688:(a) The Service shall forward to the Department of State a copy of each completed application it receives. At its option, the Department of State may provide detailed country conditions information relevant to eligibility for asylum or withholding of removal.
689-(b) At its option, the Department of State may also provide:
690-(1) An assessment of the accuracy of the applicant’s assertions about conditions in his or her country of nationality or habitual residence and his or her particular situation;
691-(2) Information about whether persons who are similarly situated to the applicant are persecuted in his or her country of nationality or habitual
692-
